@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Start selling on Lively - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Selling";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Get started";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Start selling on Lively";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('/help_centre_img/help_area/help_centre_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">

        <p>New to selling on Lively?</p>
        <p>This guide walks through the first steps of your seller journey, from creating an account to getting paid after your first show.</p>

        <h2>Step 1: Create an account and apply to sell</h2>

        <p><a href="#">Create a Lively account</a>, then tap <strong>on the profile icon</strong> on the home screen in the app to submit your seller application.</p>
        <p>The application takes just a few minutes to complete, and most sellers receive access shortly after applying.</p>

        <p><a href="#">Learn more about the seller application.</a></p>

        <h2>Step 2: Schedule your first show</h2>

        <p>Once you have seller access, schedule your first live show.</p>

        <p>During setup, you'll:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Choose a date and time</li>
            <li>Select a main category for your show</li>
            <li>Add a thumbnail that clearly highlights the items you're selling</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> You'll unlock full Seller Hub access after you complete your first show checklist and go live. Hosting your first show activates the rest of your seller tools.
        </div>

        <h2>Step 3: Prepare to go live</h2>

        <p>Before your show:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Gather your inventory</li>
            <li><a href="#">Add product listings to your shop</a></li>
            <li>Make sure you can <a href="#">print shipping labels</a></li>
            <li>Set up your camera and lighting</li>
            <li>Bring in buyers by sharing your upcoming show</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Note: Before going live you'll need to complete our <a href="#">seller verification process</a>. It only takes a few minutes.</p>

        <div class="article-info-box">
            <strong>Tip:</strong> You don't need to show your face when you go live. Many sellers simply point their camera at the items they're selling and showcase the inventory instead.
        </div>

        <p><a href="#">Explore more tips for going live in Seller Academy.</a></p>

        <h2>Step 4: Go live and sell</h2>

        <p>Start your show and engage with buyers in real time.</p>
        <p>You can run <a href="#">auctions</a>, sell fixed-price listings, and offer Giveaways during your stream.</p>

        <h2>Step 5: Ship orders and get paid</h2>

        <p>After your show:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">Generate and print your shipping labels</a></li>
            <li>Pack and ship orders</li>
            <li><a href="#">Add a payout method</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Start a payout</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p>Most sellers are paid after buyers receive their orders.</p>

        <p><a href="#">Learn more about when you'll get paid on Lively.</a></p>

        <h2>Not sure where to start?</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><a asp-action="ApplyToSell">Apply to sell on Lively</a></li>
            <li>Approved and ready? Schedule your first show in the app and go live!</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>